     "h": "CONTROL",
     "t": "p",
     "lines": [
      "Set the savings rate to zero. Then the deposit earns £0.00, the monthly add-on is £0.00, and the real monthly cost is exactly the advertised £1,200. That is the check that this is arithmetic, not a complaint."
     ]
